      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GUIDED RESPONSE\n\n1. Identify affected resources\n\n2. Notify service owners\n\n3. Monitor the maintenance window\n\n4. Record validated outcome",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GUIDED RESPONSE\n\n1. Identify affected resources\n\n2. Notify service owners\n\n3. Monitor the maintenance window\n\n4. Record validated outcome",
